==Strategy==
Healer Cat is essentially just Healer but with a slow chance rather than a crit chance. This essentially makes it much harder to actually push, and as such, even just a couple meatshields can endlessly stall Healer Cat. This stage is rather easy, as a result, with the only hard part being the beginning rush. However, even this isn't all that difficult. Just get [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut]] and meatshield spam.

